{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]There ain't nobody gonna miss me when I'm [Eb]gone
There [Eb]ain't nobody gonna mourn for me too [F7]long
Won't you [Bb]write these words upon my [Eb]headstone
There [Bb]ain't nobody gonna [F7]miss me when I'm [Bb]gone
